                                "target_lang_sense_clarification": "罕见或新颖的东西"
                            },
                            {
                                "target_lang_word": "稀罕物",
                                "target_lang_sense_clarification": "珍奇的东西"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "pos": "adjective",
            "senses": [
                {
                    "sense_id": "fa75f55c-46cf-3329-b414-0b8cff59c7d3",
                    "sense_definition": "Original, new, and interesting; different from what is typical or known.",
                    "learner_level": "B2",
                    "frequency": "Middle",
                    "semantic_group_id": "adj_quality",
                    "name_type": "no",
                    "examples": [
                        {
                            "text": "The team came up with a <w>novel</w> solution to the complex engineering problem.",
                            "target_lang_translations": {
                                "ru": "Команда придумала <w>оригинальное</w> решение сложной инженерной задачи.",
                                "zh": "团队为这个复杂的工程问题想出了一个<w>新颖的</w>解决方案。"
                            }
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "His approach to teaching history was quite <w>novel</w> and engaged the students.",
                            "target_lang_translations": {
                                "ru": "Его подход к преподаванию истории был весьма <w>новаторским</w> и увлекал студентов.",
                                "zh": "他教授历史的方法非常<w>创新</w>，吸引了学生们的参与。"
                            }
                        }
                    ],
